  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nsqrt{625}+sqrt{0.25}-sqrt{0.000025}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nsqrt{625}+sqrt{0.25}-sqrt{0.000025}\n\n= sqrt{25times 25}+sqrt{0.25}-sqrt{0.000025}\n\n= 25 + sqrt{0.5times 0.5}-sqrt{0.000025}\n\n= 25 + 0.5 – sqrt{0.005times 0.005}\n\n= 25.5 – 0.005\n\n= 25.495\n\nHence, the required value is **25.495.**",
